  <h1>About EasyHTPC</h1>

  <p>EasyHTPC is a hands-on guide to home theater PCs, media servers, and cord-cutting &mdash; written by someone who actually runs this stuff, not a content team optimizing for clicks.</p>

  <p>Every article on this site is written by <a href="/author/thomas-maxwell/"><strong>Thomas Maxwell</strong></a>, a technology professional with over 30 years of hardware experience. Thomas runs a Linux-based media server in his own home using the same tools he writes about: Mergerfs, SnapRAID, Docker, Plex, and Jellyfin. He is also actively developing NovaCast, a media player application, which gives him an inside perspective on how these systems actually work.</p>

